                "**Write a problem statement**, for example \"standard changes take about seven weeks; the business expects two\". Our [problem statement template](/templates/problem-statement-template/) helps.",
                "**Find a sponsor** with authority across the departments involved, or the future state will stall at the first boundary.",
                "**Set the boundaries:** agree the first step (\"request received\") and the last (\"change live\"), and note what is out of scope.",
